    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are coplanar unit vectors. A unit vector <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to them. If <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>26</mn></mrow></mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and the angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is <math><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8728;</mo></mrow></msup></math>, then <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is equal to"
